WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:02.437
We have Debra here from Nama Fiji.

00:00:02.437 --> 00:00:06.727
Debra, you've just experienced the
90-second Digital Wellness Reset.

00:00:06.727 --> 00:00:11.754
Could you tell us a little bit about how your
experience went and what message you

00:00:11.754 --> 00:00:13.041
received out of that?

00:00:13.041 --> 00:00:17.457
Thanks, Sangeeta. It was really quite
surreal, to be honest.

00:00:17.457 --> 00:00:23.418
I was just about to walk into a HOD meeting and
my head was in such a busy space.

00:00:23.418 --> 00:00:29.085
It was like going at a million miles an hour
and I sat and I did that Digital

00:00:29.085 --> 00:00:30.410
Wellness Reset and

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:34.429
instantly, I just blocked everything
out and became focused.

00:00:34.429 --> 00:00:37.175
It was quite amazing really to be honest.

00:00:37.175 --> 00:00:41.461
And at the end of it I just felt, you
know what, I have clarity.

00:00:41.461 --> 00:00:47.088
I can walk into my meeting now with a clear mind
and be focused and sometimes that's

00:00:47.088 --> 00:00:52.245
really hard for me because I am a bit
hyperactive and a very, very busy head.

00:00:52.245 --> 00:00:57.573
I actually think that this is going to become
part of our company before every

00:00:57.573 --> 00:01:03.242
meeting, training. I can really see the value in
this and especially these days now

00:01:03.242 --> 00:01:08.775
that everybody is so busy with mobile phones,
it's really hard to stop and switch

00:01:08.775 --> 00:01:12.668
off. And that's what it did. It
actually made me stop and

00:01:12.742 --> 00:01:15.643
just have clarity. So thank you.

00:01:15.643 --> 00:01:21.536
I loved it. Amazing. Thank you so much
for the beautiful feedback
